window.products.push({"id":421032,"name":"Teal Marble & Golden Swirls Dish Drying Mat for Kitchen, Small Microfiber Easy Storage Drying Pad, 16\" x 18\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkX+ByKIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Water Absorption: This drainable placemat uses absorbent materials inside and outside to quickly absorb moisture and keep the countertop dry and clean. Pattern Style: We designed a simple pattern for the kitchen drying mat-teal marble & golden swirls. In line with the American retro style of most home kitchens. Muti-Purpose: You can put the drying pad under the tableware, knives, and kitchen utensils to prevent metal utensils from colliding and breaking when contacting the countertop. The thickened version of the kitchen drain pad has the function of heat insulation, which can prevent hot pots from damaging the table. Lanyard Design: Convenient to hang and dry storage. Neat Hemming: The rigorous sutures are not easy to fall off. The usual simple way of care is machine wash in cold water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qkX+ByKIL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LilyCat","source_asin":"B09L47XV3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421032","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09L47XV3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09L47XV3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
