window.products.push({"id":421057,"name":"JimGumg Digital Kitchen Scale, 3kg/0.1g Mini Food Electronic Scale, High Precision Multifunctional Stainless Steel Cooking Scale","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jps-3cO2L._SL1213_.jpg","description":"PRECISE MEASUREMENT: This gram scale equipped with high precision sensor system. 3000 gram max weight capacity and reads weights in increments of 1g, Min. weight recommendation: 1g. LCD backlit display clearly shows the weighing result, perfect for weighing jewelry, food, powder, cooking, baking, preparing coffee ,daily use household articles and pet foods. VERSATILE : Our kitchen scale has the tare function, which allows you to get the exact weight of the object. In addition, our scale has one-button conversion function SMART FUNCTIONS : “T” Button calculates the net weight of your ingredients by automatically subtracting the weight of any bowl or container. ‘PCS’ button counts the pieces of items like beans, coins. 6 measurement modes(oz/ gn/ ct/ ozt/ dwt) available to change by pressing ‘M’ button. And smart indication for Overload/ Low Batteries/ Unstable, 180 seconds Auto-off for energy saving. HIGH QUALITY : The digital kitchen scale platform is made of stainless steel,which is durable and easy to clean. The design of the four-corners anti-skid base makes the weighing stable. Satisfaction Guarantee : 30 days refund or provide replacement for free; lifetime customer sale after service. If our scale doesn't meet your expectation, please let us know at first time, we always try our best to give you best shopping experience","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jps-3cO2L._SL1213_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JimGumg","source_asin":"B08Y1PGHMH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y1PGHMH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y1PGHMH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":421058,"name":"HomePro Goods Bedroom Drawer Organizers, Set of 3 Underwear, Sock and Lingerie Storage Boxes with Lid (Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UAp-mXTTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Secret to Keeping your Dresser Drawers Neat and Tidy Tired of digging around in your sock and underwear drawers, never finding what you need? The HomePro Goods 3 piece drawer organizer set is an instant solution to bring order to your bedroom. Organize your underwear, bras, socks, scarves, baby clothes, and much more the easy way! Each item sits in its own individual compartment so you can see everything at a glance and grab anything you need instantly. With your items neatly stored, you conserve space and you can fit more inside your drawers. The light floral pattern looks equally nice sitting in your bedroom or tucked away in the closet or dresser. A great storage solution for kids or adults. Materials The drawer organizers are made from durable 600D oxford cloth, which is a high quality water and tear-resistant polyester fabric. Reinforced with heavy cardboard, they are both study and stackable. Each organizer box measures 12.50 x 9.50 x 4.72 inches (33 x 23.5 x 12 cm) from the base. When closed, they measure 13 inches long and 5 inches tall from the lid. Drawer Organizer Compartment Sizes The 3 piece set includes the following organizer boxes: 18 cells; perfect when used as a sock or underwear organizer. 8 cells; great for bulkier socks, child's tights, gloves or small tees.  6 cells; good to keep lingerie, most bras, scarves or thicker rolled socks. Note: The 6 cell storage box is not designed for larger size underwire bras. To be sure you are happy with your purchase, we suggest you measure your bras first. Kids Bedroom Storage A great storage solution for kid’s rooms. Extend your boy or girls bedroom storage space. The fabric color choices make ideal children clothing organizers and storage boxes.  Click the Add to Cart button to transform your bedroom and simplify your life today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81UAp-mXTTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomePro Goods","source_asin":"B00XAWNVUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XAWNVUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XAWNVUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
