window.products.push({"id":421063,"name":"Stainless Steel Steak Knife Set. This Set of 5 Steak Knives Is a Perfect Starter Set in Any Kitchen.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vq4APzrGL._AC_.jpg","description":"You are getting a good stainless steel steak knife set. This set of 5 stainless steel steak knives is a perfect starter set for any kitchen in someone's new home or apartment, for newly married or single - even a college dorm! And if you do not want to use your \"good\" cutlery for that BBQ, camping, picnic or beach trip - then this durable quality set is for you. With a sharp 4 3/8\" serrated blade and black plastic handle that is dishwasher safe (although we always recommend hand washing and drying for ALL cutlery) - you do not need to look any further! Great for beginner cooks that are looking for a simple steak knife at an everyday value. Featuring 8 1/2\" long steak knife with a black handle, a sharp serrated blade that provides optimum sharpness for precise cutting but easy to re-sharpen, corrosion resistant stainless steel and easy dishwasher safe cutlery. Every steak deserves a knife that lets you cut the meat without a fight. You can cut through thick cuts of meat with ease without tearing. The tapered shape ensures that the knife won't catch on anything as you cut, so slices come out smooth and even, and because you don't need to press down hard to cut, juices stay in the meat to improve the taste and texture of your meal. Use them for a casual barbecue or during a romantic steak dinner for that special occasion. These knives can be used in both a casual or formal setting - your choice. Although this set is not the best stainless steel steak knife on the market - you are not paying for the best either! Just an everyday good value set for your use. You can even get 2 sets for those bigger gatherings of friends or family! That way when one knife invariably comes up missing (out with the trash) - you will not feel depressed about it!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Vq4APzrGL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bulk buys","source_asin":"B00GDY2MVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GDY2MVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GDY2MVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
