window.products.push({"id":421115,"name":"Smoke Eraser V5 | Personal Air Purifier Filter with 1000+ Uses | Eliminates Odor & Protects from 2nd Hand Smoke Buddy Roommate Family etc. | 4x Lifesp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U5qbs8U1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Without ability to block, collect, and remove breath moisture, HEPA filters fail, rarely exceeding just 300 uses. The key to exceeding 1000 exhales is keeping the HEPA filter dry. So from day one, Smoke Eraser has been blocking the liquid portion of breath with a patent pending hydrophobic mesh, and has a removable lid to allow user to ventilate unit of the passing gaseous portion (water vapor). Significantly prolonging our advanced HEPA filter life, average users can expect 1000+ exhales from a single Smoke Eraser. Not bad as this often triples the competition. But add a 2nd, and it's a whole new ballgame. Adding a 2nd unit into rotation doesn't just double output, it multiplies it. So users often see 6+ months when using a SE Pair. Seemingly magical how adding another unit can improve longevity by so much, but it's actually simpler than that. It's just the additional 24 hours each unit provides the other for drying out that makes this happen. Having the 2nd in rotation is what provides the back-up eliminating any downtime while the 1st one dries, and vice versa. So when dried, units reset to an almost like new condition. To maintain the Smoke Eraser, it's just a matter of removing lids after sessions to allow units to dry out. Remembering this is critical. This of course unless you have a Docking Station. A unit bought just once that will multiply life to every unit you ever buy again, whether Smoke Eraser or Smoke Buddy as the Dock was made to fit either brand. AKA: our Lifespan Multiplier, this patent pending product continuously dries the units for you keeping them constantly wide open. Check out the Docking Station listing for more details.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U5qbs8U1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SMOKE ERASER","source_asin":"B0C6RF41T9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421115","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6RF41T9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6RF41T9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
