window.products.push({"id":421126,"name":"DII Cotton Zig Zag Weave Dish Clothes, 12 x 12 Set of 6, Heavy Duty Kitchen Bar Mop for Drying & Cleaning-Neon Lime Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WncZntRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Tackle Your Kitchen Works With DII Dish Towels/Dish Cloths DII Zig Zag Barmop Dish Towels/Dish Cloths are must-own kitchen essentials for every household. The thick woven fabric can take care of all heavy cleaning duties in your kitchen or anywhere else in your home Everyday Kitchen Essentials We offer Zig Zag Dishtowel measuring 18 x 28\" with Set of 4 and Dishcloth measures 12 x 12” with Set of 6, making sure dishes and countertops are dry while the dishcloth ensures everything is scrubbed down. Our sets are available in a variety of colors for your choices. Quality you can rely on DII dishtowels are made with high quality 100% cotton with tight knit allow for less lint on your glass or plates. The perfect dishtowel for your daily kitchen use for holding up to your tough kitchen grease, dirt, food and more. The material and construction provides a long lasting dish towels/dish cloths that you can use over and over again. Washing and Care Instructions • Wash towels before first use. Towels will lose any lint remaining from the weaving process, and will become softer and more absorbent after washing.  • Wash: Use Cold water, Color Separated; DO NOT use bleach  • Do not use fabric softner (coats the cotton fibers causing towel to become less absorbent)  • Dry towels in Tumble cycle to minimize shrinkage.  • May be ironed with low heat. So Many Great Options To view our entire selection of options search: DII Dish Towels, DII Dish Cloths or visit our brand page at amazon.com/dii for a full range of products. Our Dish Towels/Dish Cloths Products Include: • Barmop Dish Towels/Dish Cloths • Printed and Embroidered Design Dish Towels • French Stripe Dish Towels • Assorted Dish Towels • Gourmet Dish Towels/Dish Cloths • Damask Dish Towels • Zig Zag Weave Dish Towels/Dish Cloths • Holiday Dish Towels • Jacquard Dish towels  • Terry Dish Towels//Dish Cloths","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WncZntRNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DII","source_asin":"B07BF1PV9V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BF1PV9V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BF1PV9V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
