window.products.push({"id":421233,"name":"ALEGTER Memory Foam Door Mat for Entrance,Water Absorbent and Machine Washable Floor Mat for Kitchen Bedroom Restroom Indoor and Outdoor(24 x 36 Inch,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S4BsrcgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Strong Absorbs Water & Dirt- Alegter memory foam door mat is made of ultra-soft microfiber coral velvet outer material and thick,cushiony memory foam filling,which is fluffy and soft, super absorbent, and quickly catches mud and dirt to keep shoes and floors clean and tidy,you can also use the mats in the bathroom.I believe these floor mats for home will make your house cleaner and more comfortable. Low Profile & Versatile- The doormat indoor entrance is designed to be 0.8 inches thick, and the low profile design ensures that the door won't jam and the front door rug will stay in place. Available in a variety of colors and sizes, you can place them on front and back doors, entryways, interior entrances, patios, garages, kitchens, laundry rooms and other high traffic areas. Easy to Clean & Machine Wash- Alegter floor mat is super easy to clean. Machine wash with cold water and mild detergent. Do not use chlorine or bleach. The color of the bath mats will not fade,NOTE: Keep the front door mat indoor dry completely before the next use. Multi Purpose Use-These front door rug perfect for entry, vanity, vacation home, master bathroom, kid's bathroom and guest suite. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Father's Day, Mother's Day and Valentine's Day. Warm Prompt- Since the indoor mat is packed by being folded up, it’s normal that the entrance rug arrives with creases. To remove the creases, we suggest putting the entry mat in the dryer on high heat for 5 min and the back will temporarily soften slightly, then quickly remove it from the dryer and either roll up or put it directly on the floor. After a few days' use, the fold marks could almost completely be gone. NOTICE: Please check the size before buying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S4BsrcgmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALEGTER","source_asin":"B0BW3PMSR8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BW3PMSR8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BW3PMSR8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
