window.products.push({"id":421344,"name":"ZEZHOU Refrigerator Thermometer 2 Pack - Wireless Digital Fridge Freezer Room Temperature Monitor with Magnetic Hook, Large Big LCD Display for Indoor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b2s8e964L._SL1000_.jpg","description":"The Refrigerator Freezer Thermometer provides superior results for commercial and industrial food service environments. Compact and accurate, this refrigerator and freezer thermometer provides crucial temperature readings for food safety applications. Why Zezhou Fridge and Freezer Thermometer? ♦ Combination of fridge thermometer and freezer thermometer, It’s great ideal for Indoor, Outdoor, Kitchen, Home, Restaurants, Bars, Cafes ♦ Compact and waterproof design with very easy-to-read LCD screen ♦ Foldable hook and small magnet allow you to place anywhere you want ♦ Monitor temperatures from -4 °F to 140 °F (-20 °C to 60 °C), telling you the most accurate result. ♦ Frost Alarm: When temperature range is 4.0 Degree to 7.9 Degree, you can see a little snowflake pattern on this LCD screen to remind you that frost will show up. ♦ Ensure your food is being stored at the appropriate safe temperature to extend the usage life and end early perishable. ♦ Warranty Guarantee: - 24/7 Customer Service - 12-Month Replacement Warranty - 60-Day Money Back Guarantee Please contact us directly if need any help Specifications: Measuring Temperature Range: -20°C to 60°C/ -4°F to 140°F [Note: It will show “LL.L” if it goes below -20 °C and “HH.H” for above +60 °C.]  Accuracy: ±1°C/±2°F Resolution: 0.1°C/0.2°F Waterproof Structure Level: IPX3 When and How to replace the battery? Replace the battery when the reading becomes erratic or the display clarity fades. Open the screw and the ABS shell, and replace with a new CR2032 battery which you can easily get from store. (Battery: 3V Model CR2032 Lithium Battery) Note: 1. Do not soak it in water. 2. When the display is dim, please replace the battery as the instruction says and tighten the screws. 3. It needs about a minute for reaction about the temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51b2s8e964L._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZEZHOU","source_asin":"B08TM1NG38","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TM1NG38","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TM1NG38","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
