window.products.push({"id":421604,"name":"Cake Boss Countertop Accessories 7-Piece Melamine Mixing and Prep Bowl Set, \"Icing\" Pattern, Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ww16HLWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set the home bakery up for every mixing and prepping task, with the Cake Boss Countertop Accessories 7-Piece Melamine Mixing and Prep Bowl Set. Each of the bowls is sturdily constructed from durable, easy-to-clean melamine, with a festive bakeshop look. The bowls have rubberized bases to help keep them in place on the countertop as you work and they're all conveniently top-rack dishwasher safe. The set includes four 8-ounce prep bowls with bright interior color, perfect for helping to keep pre-measured ingredients like sugar, eggs and liquids at hand for the next baking step. With three mixing bowls in 1-8/10-, 2- and 3-quart sizes, there's always a bowl handy for mixing batters, dough's, frostings and more! And each mixing bowl sports a convenient handle and pour spout to make the baking process even easier. The fun \"Icing\" pattern on the cream-colored exterior of each bowl adds a festive pop of color and personality. Best of all, these durable mixing and prep bowls provide the perfect partner with other Cake Boss Countertop Accessories and Cake Boss Tools. First get \"prepped\" then get in the mix, with the sturdy, colorful Cake Boss Countertop Accessories 7-Piece Melamine Mixing and Prep Bowl Set.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ww16HLWLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cake Boss","source_asin":"B00L8XO88I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421604","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L8XO88I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L8XO88I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
