window.products.push({"id":421711,"name":"Latex Foam Pillow, Orthopedic Pillows for Sleeping with Machine Washable Pillowcase, Natural and Soft Density with an Additional Travel Neck Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZ45wC4tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Latex Foam Pillow, Orthopedic Pillows for Sleeping with Machine Washable Pillowcase, Natural and Soft Density with an Additional Travel Neck Pillow. Our latex pillow helps to relieve pain and reduce sleep discomfort by taking pressure off the neck and back joints. Kind Reminder: 【1】 Our pillow are vacuum-packed. Please leave the pillow in a dry and ventilated place for 1-2 days after you received it. 【2】 For those who are extremely sensitive and cannot stand the latex smell, this pillow may not be your best choice. 【3】 Keep the pillow away from direct sunlight which will cause its surface powdery. 【4】 Different people have different feelings for the softness and hardness of the pillow. If you feel uncomfortable with the hardness of the pillow, you can return it to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eZ45wC4tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SweetSpace","source_asin":"B08DR65H5M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08DR65H5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08DR65H5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
