window.products.push({"id":421810,"name":"R&R Home Bundle - Weighted Blanket & 2 Duvet Covers | Large | 48\"x72\" | Teal & White Check with Aqua & White Check/Plaid Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ds9Rr-+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ADVANCED 7 LAYER DESIGN: Our innovative 7 layer design provides superior rest and relaxation. The 100% cotton outer-layer is super breathable for temperature control, and is lined with multiple layers padding for enhance comfort. PRECISION STITCHING: Millions of tiny glass beads are carefully stitched into 4”x4” diamond shaped pockets to provide the blanket’s weight. These pockets allow the blanket to conform to the contours of your body, while ensuring the weight remains evenly distributed by preventing the beads from shifting to other pockets or sections. COMPLETE SET: Includes an easy to remove duvet cover to protect your favorite blanket. All our duvet covers have 8 tie-down points and an elongated zipper that extends the entire length of one side. The additional tie-downs keeps your cover firmly attached to your blanket and prevents the blanket shifting or bunching up, while the longer zipper makes removal hassle free. MACHINE WASHABLE: Designed to make cleaning fast and easy. The removable cover ensures your blanket will last for years by protecting it from stains, accidents. Because the cover is removable, the blanket does not need to be washed as often, reducing wear and tear. To clean your weighted blanket and cover, separate the cover from the blanket and wash them both in cold water. Tumble on low for the cover, and air dry the blanket. MIX & MATCH: All R&R Home's blankets and covers (of the same size) are interchangeable. Extra covers are available so you can quickly change your cover to match any home décor. No need to be stuck with just one cover design forever, your blanket can keep up with latest trends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Ds9Rr-+GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"R&R Home","source_asin":"B07TM17SYG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421810","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TM17SYG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TM17SYG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
