window.products.push({"id":421877,"name":"Set of 3 Rectangular Decorative Storage Box and 1 Mini Metal bucket with Handle, Deer Printed Nesting Tins with Lids, Empty Metal Boxes, Tin Can Conta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPLRSxKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FEATURES: - Package included: 3 storage boxes of different sizes + 1 small tin bucket- The food grade tinplate make the tins safe and non-toxic to store food. - These small boxes can be conveniently placed anywhere. Can be used for home and office storage, very suitable for Christmas, New Year, boutiques, department stores, homes, parties, etc. Add more color and beauty to your place.- The small tin bucket can be used to store and organize small trinket and craft supplies around the house. Or create custom succulent planters for your garden. NOTES: Just clean it with water or neutral detergent, and then use a soft, dry cloth to dry it along the grain. Tin cans should avoid contact with oil stains as far as possible, and avoid scratching with hard objects. If you live by the sea, please wipe it with a damp cloth frequently, because the salt in the air will darken its luster. After cleaning, be sure to rinse thoroughly and wipe dry in time, because residual detergent and water droplets will damage the surface gloss of the tin. Do not place it near the fire for a long time to bake. REMINDER: These cans are sealed by stuck close, but there is a possibility of leakage when storing liquid.  Please confirm the size and volume of the product before your purchase.  Because of difference between different monitors,the picture may not reflect the actual color of the item.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPLRSxKFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warmforhom","source_asin":"B09NBKFY4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NBKFY4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NBKFY4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
