window.products.push({"id":421923,"name":"Viking Professional 5 -quart Stand Mixer, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aKIU3AALL._AC_.jpg","description":"With 800 watts of power, the Viking professional stand mixers provides enough brawn to knead any dough into submission. But they do have a tender side, with a range of settings delicate enough for even the most sensitive meringue. Designed to meet the needs of a pro, it offers a rugged, all-metal gear transmission. This 5-quart mixer comes with exclusive V-style stainless steel beater, stainless steel whip, stainless steel dough hook, and stainless steel mixing bowl with ergonomic cast-stainless bowl handle. Viking's exclusive easy glide rear wheels make it easy for maneuverability of the entire unit on your countertop. Choose from primary, low and high speeds to mix, blend, whip and knead. With the planetary mixing action in operation, it ensures thorough results. The pop-up head lift locks in both the up and down positions. Exclusive large, easy to control power/speed selector knob. There are numerous attachments available for this unit to increase its multi-tasking capabilities. Fits under standard cabinets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41aKIU3AALL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Viking Range","source_asin":"B001AGS1D6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001AGS1D6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001AGS1D6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":421924,"name":"Flexyfoot Shock Absorbing Oval Handled Folding Walking Stick - Improves Safety, Improves Grip, Reduces Shocks & Jarring","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEl9rMgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This black Flexyfoot Shock Absorbing Oval Handle Folding Walking Stick has a number of features that have been designed to improve comfort, stability and safety for the user, and that help to reduce the risk of slips and falls, whilst also improving comfort. The wide, comfortable oval handle has been designed to help spread the weight of the user evenly through the hand, cushioning the shock and jarring usually felt in the joints when the stick impacts the ground. The walking stick is fitted with the uniquely designed Flexyfoot walking stick ferrule for additional comfort and safety. The Flexyfoots flexible bellow acts as a shock absorber to reduce jarring in the wrist, arm and shoulder joints. The slightly flexible design of the Flexyfoot, and the hardwearing nature of its foot tread combine to give the user up to 50% more grip than a traditional ferrule, ensuring full contact with the ground at all times for maximum safety. This black Flexyfoot walking stick is height adjustable and suitable for all users between 5’ 3” (160cms) – 6’ 8” (200cms) in height. Made from premium grade aluminium with superior tooled joints, it is lightweight but strong, with a maximum user weight of 130kgs (20 st).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eEl9rMgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexyfoot","source_asin":"B092D94N5H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-421924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092D94N5H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092D94N5H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
